      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} when the game was launched a Nintendo Switch Pro controller was connected via Steam Input over USB.\n\nI tried disconnecting the controller, disabling Steam Input, and using keyboard controls with the game running but it still showed SteamVR controls.\n\nI can attempt to repro later today to see if it happens every time.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
