  "details": "When viewing the \"Controls\" settings menu, rather than getting the keyboard, or controller, infographics in Desktop Mode, VRChat instead presents the \"SteamVR\" VR control options, including a non-functioning button to edit SteamVR Bindings (as SteamVR is not running).\n\nThis appears to be a regression of: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/using-gamepad-on-desktop-mode-registers-as-a-steamvr-input-in-settings",
